  "sections": [
    {
      "h2": "One marketplace for every business service",
      "html": "<p>Running a business means juggling tax, people, customers, technology and the law, often across borders. ProSourced brings the professionals who help with all of it into one place, so you can compare options without dozens of searches and sales calls.</p><ul><li><strong>Finance:</strong> <a href=\"/accounting/\">accountants</a> and <a href=\"/payroll/\">payroll services</a>.</li><li><strong>People:</strong> <a href=\"/hr-outsourcing/\">HR outsourcing</a> and <a href=\"/recruitment/\">recruitment</a>.</li><li><strong>Growth:</strong> <a href=\"/management-consulting/\">management consultants</a>, <a href=\"/digital-marketing/\">digital marketing</a> and <a href=\"/branding/\">branding</a>.</li><li><strong>Digital:</strong> <a href=\"/web-design/\">web design</a> and <a href=\"/it-cyber-security/\">IT and cyber security</a>.</li><li><strong>Going global:</strong> <a href=\"/company-formation/\">company formation</a>, <a href=\"/translation/\">translation</a> and <a href=\"/legal-services/\">business lawyers</a>.</li><li><strong>Admin:</strong> <a href=\"/virtual-assistants/\">virtual assistants</a>.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "h2": "Built for businesses that think globally",
      "html": "<p>Rules on tax, payroll, employment and data change at every border. Each ProSourced guide covers what differs between the United States, the United Kingdom and the European Union, with notes for Canada, Australia and other markets, so you know which qualifications and questions matter where you trade.</p>"
    },
    {
      "h2": "Are you a professional?",
      "html": "<p>Accountants, consultants, designers, developers, marketers, lawyers and other business service providers can <a href=\"/for-professionals/\">find out how to get listed</a>, and use our free <a href=\"/free-tools/hourly-rate-calculator/\">hourly rate calculator</a>.</p>"
    }
  ],
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "Is ProSourced free for businesses?",
      "a": "Yes. Browsing, comparing and using our free tools costs nothing, and there’s no obligation to hire."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which countries does ProSourced cover?",
      "a": "Our guides are written for businesses in the United States, United Kingdom and European Union, with notes for Canada, Australia and other markets. Many services, such as design, marketing and virtual assistants, can be delivered remotely from anywhere."
    },
    {
      "q": "Does ProSourced vet the professionals?",
      "a": "No. We’re an introduction and comparison service. Each guide explains which credentials to check and where to verify them, and you agree terms directly with the professional you choose."
    },
    {
      "q": "How does ProSourced make money?",
      "a": "Some links are referral links, so partner platforms may pay us a fee when we introduce you, at no extra cost to you."
    }
  ],
